      "content": "Here is a script segment for you:\n\n\"Here is the critical piece most advocates ignore: a complete avoidance of natural and logical consequences is fundamentally a disservice to a developing brain. The pre-frontal cortex, responsible for judgment and executive function, *learns* through predictable cause and effect, not just through praise. When we consistently sweep away the fallout from a choice, we are essentially telling the powerful part of their brain that the *rules of reality don't apply to them*, fundamentally stunting their ability to self-correct and understand genuine accountability later in life.",
